<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-3482] Incorrect user is picked up by Zeppelin during relogin after Knox SSO token expiry</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3482</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Steps to reproduce :&lt;br/&gt;
1) Enable SSO for zeppelin&lt;br/&gt;
2) Keep the token expiry time to small value say 5secs.&lt;br/&gt;
3) Login using user&#160;&quot;user1&quot;&lt;br/&gt;
4) After 5secs, check that user is logged out due to token expiry&lt;br/&gt;
5) Now try to login with different user &quot;user2&quot;&lt;br/&gt;
6) Still zeppelin is picking up older user &quot;user1&quot;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
